    "created_at": "2022-12-01T04:45:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-01T04:45:01Z",
    "body": "@benjamin051000 That's because it's up-to-date and dependency-free.\r\nDistro packages are mostly maintained by others, so some may fall behind on releases, as was the case for Fedora.\r\nCargo requires Rust to be installed and up-to-date. Out of date cargo will show cryptic build failures, so it isn't immediately obvious what's wrong.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
